{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/787255-totemic-empowerment","id":787255,"title":"Totemic Empowerment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-16T03:36:09-08:00","id":787255,"title":"Totemic Empowerment","content":"Quick questions about Totemic Empowerment:<br /> <br /> <b>1)</b> Do you use the totems Power + Finesse like normal when rolling the Numina your totem gives you?<br /> <b>2)</b> What do you roll to use your totems Influences?<br /> <b>3)</b> Does using Influence or Numina use your essence or the totem's essence?<br /> <b>4)</b> Influence says it can add to the Defense of a beneficiary. How much?<br /> <b>5)</b> What is the base essence cost of Blast?<br /> <b>6)</b> What is the base essence cost of Drain?<br /> <b>7)</b> Does Drain give you willpower/essence or your totem willpower/essence?<br /> <b>8)</b> Are you considered Claimed during this time?<br /> <b>9)</b> When Totemic Empowerment ends, does your totem go back to where it was when the ritual was done?<br /> <b>10)</b> When Totemic Empowerment ends, does your totem go into Twilight or cross back over into the Hisil?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T04:21:46-08:00","id":787269,"title":"","content":"1) My first response was 'Yes' but I can also see that it might be better if based off Presence + Wits of the character<br /> 2) Same as above, need to mull this one over and double-check what my original intention with the rite was.<br /> 3) Your Essence.<br /> 4) Equal to Rank, I think?<br /> 5) 0 Essence.<br /> 6) 0 Essence.<br /> 7) You.<br /> 8) For what purposes?<br /> 9) No, it decouples right where you currently are.<br /> 10) Twilight.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T04:35:12-08:00","id":787275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/787255-totemic-empowerment?p=787269#post787269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">8) For what purposes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Iminir bonus to gifts, for example.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned"